{"strings": [
  {"text":"FILE No. 0417","translation":"СПРАВА № 0417","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/desk.js"},
  {"text":"UNDER OBSERVATION","translation":"ПІД НАГЛЯДОМ","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/desk.js"},
  {"text":"CASE FILES","translation":"ОСОБОВІ СПРАВИ","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/deskfront.js"},
  {"text":"Dr I. V. Strogova","translation":"Д-р І. В. Строгова","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/nameplate.js"},
  {"text":"psychotherapist","translation":"психотерапевтка","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/nameplate.js"},
  {"text":"ONE AT A TIME","translation":"ПО ОДНІЙ","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/tissues.js"},
  {"text":"it's just a mirror","translation":"це просто дзеркало","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"EXIT","translation":"ВИХІД —","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"only after the session","translation":"після закінчення сеансу","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"YOUR FEELINGS MATTER*","translation":"ВАШІ ПОЧУТТЯ ВАЖЛИВІ*","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"*and will be noted","translation":"*і будуть враховані","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"Dr Strogova's Office","translation":"Кабінет д-ра Строгової","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"Make yourself comfortable. As far as that's possible.","translation":"Влаштовуйтеся зручніше. Наскільки це можливо.","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Sit down. The armchair is exactly where it should be.","translation":"Сідайте. Крісло стоїть точно там, де має стояти.","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"Your file is already open. It's thicker than you thought.","translation":"Вашу справу вже відкрито. Вона товща, ніж ви думали.","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"Tissues: one at a time. That is part of the therapy too.","translation":"Серветки — по одній. Це теж частина терапії.","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"The clock on the wall says ten to three: the session's time is up.","translation":"Годинник на стіні показує 14:50 — час сеансу вийшов.","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/script.js"},
  {"text":"The page in the file is full: the doctor has written it from top to bottom.","translation":"У справі скінчилася сторінка: лікарка списала її повністю.","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/script.js"}
]}
